<main>
  <div class='page-head' id='intro'>
    <p class='eyebrow'>Group disability</p>
    <h1>Submit a disability claim</h1>
    <p class='lede'>Identify the member, confirm their plan details, record the absence information and attach the supporting documents. Everything you submit here reaches MapleSure intake as a single packet with one reference number.</p>
